---
pagination:
  data: pages.sponsors.locales
  size: 1
  alias: locale
permalink: "{{ locale.permalink }}"
---
{#
  TAQATHON - SPONSORS PAGE TEMPLATE (src/pages/sponsors.njk)
  -------------------------------------------------------------
  One section per tier, one box per sponsor within it. The tier
  currently on this page ("Partners") is REAL content, not
  placeholder — board-approved 2026 partners, not stand-ins — so
  .sponsor-box is a solid card, not the dashed "not final yet"
  treatment an earlier round used here (that treatment now correctly
  lives only on genuinely-placeholder content, if any tier like that
  gets added back later). Each sponsor renders its real logo when one
  exists (s.logoSrc), and falls back to name-only text when it
  doesn't — see sponsors.*.json's "_comment" for exactly which
  partners have a logo file and which don't; nothing here is invented.

  VISUAL SYSTEM (Phase 3, editorial rollout, page 4 — see about.njk
  for the token-system rationale). Tier hierarchy is expressed
  typographically (Platinum's heading is largest, Supporting's is
  smallest) instead of through color or badges, since color is
  already spoken for by the accent-role rule elsewhere on the site.

  SUPERVISORS/SUPPORTERS (2026-08-18): a second section below the
  tiers, moved here from the Contact page per user request — real
  logo-bearing entities, so they render actual <img> logos in solid
  cards (see .sp-org-panel), not the dashed placeholder-box tiers use.
  Data lives in supervisors.items / supporters.items in the copy JSON.
#}
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block pageHead %}
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Big+Shoulders+Display:wght@600;700;800&family=Tajawal:wght@700;800;900&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{% endblock %}
{% block pageStyle %}
.sp-hero{ background:var(--color-cream); color:var(--brand-dark); padding:4rem 0 3rem; position:relative; overflow:hidden; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,40,76,.08); }
.sp-hero::before{ content:""; position:absolute; top:-20%; inset-inline-end:-10%; width:420px; height:420px; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(196,64,26,.08), transparent 70%); border-radius:50%; pointer-events:none; z-index:0; }
.sp-hero .container{ position:relative; z-index:1; max-width:760px; text-align:center; }
.sp-display{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; font-size:clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem); line-height:1; letter-spacing:-.01em; margin:0 0 .75rem; }
[dir="rtl"] .sp-display{ font-family:'Tajawal', var(--font-display); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:0; }
.sp-hero-intro{ color:var(--color-dust); max-width:46ch; margin:0 auto; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sp-hero{ color:var(--text); border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sp-hero::before{ background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(232,149,43,.10), transparent 70%); }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sp-hero-intro{ color:var(--muted); }

.sp-tiers-section{ background:var(--color-sky); padding:3.5rem 0 4rem; }
.sp-tiers-section .container{ max-width:900px; }
.sp-tier{ margin-bottom:3rem; }
.sp-tier:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
.sp-tier-label{ font-family:var(--font-mono-label); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; font-size:.7rem; color:var(--color-terra); display:block; margin-bottom:.4rem; }
[dir="rtl"] .sp-tier-label{ font-family:inherit; text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sp-tier-label{ color:var(--color-amber); }
{#
  Three tier ranks, three heading sizes — .sp-tier-1 (Platinum) is
  biggest, .sp-tier-3 (Supporting) is smallest. Nunjucks' loop.index
  in the markup below picks which modifier class applies per tier, so
  adding a 4th tier in the data file just keeps shrinking down the
  same scale instead of needing a new CSS rule.
#}
.sp-tier-heading{ font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:700; color:var(--brand-dark); margin-bottom:1.25rem; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-.01em; }
[dir="rtl"] .sp-tier-heading{ font-family:'Tajawal', var(--font-display); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:0; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sp-tier-heading{ color:var(--text); }
.sp-tier-1 .sp-tier-heading{ font-size:clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem); }
.sp-tier-2 .sp-tier-heading{ font-size:1.5rem; }
.sp-tier-3 .sp-tier-heading{ font-size:1.15rem; }
.sponsor-box{
  border:1px solid rgba(0,40,76,.08); border-radius:.75rem;
  padding:1.25rem 1rem; text-align:center; color:var(--brand-dark); font-weight:600;
  background:#fff; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
  display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:.75rem; height:100%; justify-content:center;
}
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sponsor-box{ border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08); color:var(--text); background:var(--surface); box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
.sponsor-box .sp-org-logo{ max-height:56px; }

{#
  Supervisors/supporters (2026-08-18): unlike the tiers above, these
  ARE real, logo-bearing, confirmed entities (moved here from the
  Contact page, which used to carry them) — so they get a solid card
  with an actual <img> logo, not the dashed placeholder-box treatment
  the tiers use. Same white/var(--surface) panel style as the rest of
  this redesign (see about.njk's token-system rationale) rather than
  inventing a third card look for this page alone.
#}
.sp-org-section{ background:var(--color-cream); padding:0 0 4rem; }
.sp-org-panel{
  background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(0,40,76,.08); border-radius:1rem;
  padding:1.75rem; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.04); margin-bottom:1.5rem;
}
.sp-org-panel:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sp-org-panel{ background:var(--surface); border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08); box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
.sp-org-logo{ max-height:70px; width:auto; object-fit:contain; }
.sp-org-badge{ background:rgba(196,64,26,.1); color:var(--brand-dark); font-weight:700; }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sp-org-badge{ background:rgba(232,149,43,.14); color:var(--text); }
.sp-org-name{ color:var(--color-dust); }
[data-bs-theme="dark"] .sp-org-name{ color:var(--muted); }
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<section class="sp-hero">
<div class="container">
  <h1 class="sp-display">{{ locale.content.hero.heading }}</h1>
  <p class="sp-hero-intro">{{ locale.content.hero.intro }}</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sp-tiers-section">
<div class="container">
  {% for tier in locale.content.tiers %}
  <div class="sp-tier sp-tier-{{ loop.index }}">
    <span class="sp-tier-label">{{ loop.index | pad2 }}</span>
    <h2 class="sp-tier-heading">{{ tier.tierName }}</h2>
    <div class="row g-3">
      {% for s in tier.sponsors %}
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-4">
        <div class="sponsor-box">
          {% if s.logoSrc %}
          <img src="{{ locale.pathPrefix | default('') }}{{ s.logoSrc }}" alt="{{ s.logoAlt }}" class="img-fluid sp-org-logo">
          {% endif %}
          <span>{{ s.name }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
</section>

{% if locale.content.supervisors or locale.content.supporters %}
<section class="sp-org-section">
<div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">

  {% if locale.content.supervisors %}
  <div class="sp-org-panel">
    <h2 class="h6 sp-tier-heading text-center mb-3" style="font-size:1.15rem;">{{ locale.content.supervisors.heading }}</h2>
    <div class="row g-3 justify-content-center align-items-center text-center">
      {% for s in locale.content.supervisors.items %}
      <div class="col-6 col-md-5 d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center">
        <div style="height:90px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
          <img src="{{ locale.pathPrefix | default('') }}{{ s.logoSrc }}" alt="{{ s.logoAlt }}" class="img-fluid sp-org-logo">
        </div>
        <div style="min-height:50px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-top:.75rem;">
          <div class="badge rounded-pill px-3 py-2 sp-org-badge">{{ s.badgeText }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="small sp-org-name mt-2">{{ s.orgName }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if locale.content.supporters %}
  <div class="sp-org-panel">
    <h2 class="h6 sp-tier-heading text-center mb-3" style="font-size:1.15rem;">{{ locale.content.supporters.heading }}</h2>
    <div class="row g-3 justify-content-evenly align-items-center text-center">
      {% for s in locale.content.supporters.items %}
      <div class="col-6 col-md-3 d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
        <img src="{{ locale.pathPrefix | default('') }}{{ s.logoSrc }}" alt="{{ s.logoAlt }}" class="img-fluid sp-org-logo mb-2">
        <div class="small sp-org-name text-center">{{ s.orgName }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

</div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% endblock %}
